  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Medicine Regulation, Access and Safety</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment under the Partnerships for a Healthy Region (PHR) Initiative will support partner countries to improve capabilities, resources, regulatory mechanisms and systems to meet national health needs. The investment originally comprised complementary activities by Australia&#x2019;s Therapeutic Goods Administration and the Australian Institute of Health and Welfare to provide tailored support to national authorities in the Indo-Pacific. In the interest of administrative clarity, the partnership with the Australian Institute of Health and Welfare has been moved to INO405.</narrative>
  </description>
